{"title": "Formsculpt: Tressym", "pageid": 40258, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Formsculpt:_Tressym", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 9 Spells", "Transmutation spells", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Formsculpt_Tressym.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Formsculpt_Tressym.webp/300px-Formsculpt_Tressym.webp, /w/images/5/5b/Formsculpt_Tressym.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Formsculpt_Tressym.webp/300px-Formsculpt_Tressym.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Formsculpt_Tressym.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Formsculpt Tressym</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 9 transmutation spell</a>. It transforms a creature into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tressym\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tressym\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tressym\">Tressym</a></span>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Rearrange a creature's very being into the image of Gale's darling pet. \n</p>\nIf the tressym's hit points drop to 0, the target reverts to its original form with its original hit points.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Polymorphed_.28Tressym.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Polymorphed_(Tressym)\"> Condition: Polymorphed (Tressym) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 5  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Changed into a beast.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Only <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> can have this during some story outcomes in the Epilogue</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035832\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2158/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22921/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9700/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1044958/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n141.93%   62.862     23 Template:Trim\n100.00%   44.290      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   44.290      1 -total\n 25.76%   11.408      3 Template:Icon_text\n 22.74%   10.072      2 Template:Icon_link\n 20.03%    8.871      1 Template:FRWiki\n 19.50%    8.637      1 Template:Condition\n 16.29%    7.215      3 Template:Ifempty\n 14.91%    6.603      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.76%    5.651      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40258-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035832 and revision id 362570. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}